    <item>
      <title>Neuberger Berman on "Underweight" European Equities</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-10-16/why-neuberger-berman-has-neutral-stance-on-global-stocks-video</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">3cef413ae232ac9d4d8d2d62</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 08:28:26 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Neuberger Berman CIO Maya Bhandari says the firm recently cut back on global equities to "target" for the first time in four years, with Europe underweight due to its cyclical bias, heavy concentration in autos and banks, and limited AI exposure. She tells Bloomberg this is in contrast to Japan and China, with their stronger earnings and valuations.
(Source: SBS Studio)</description>
